  "description": "Run singleton background work safely alongside a horizontally-scaled HTTP tier. Splits a service into Api and Worker roles from ONE image, and guards each sweep with a Postgres advisory lock so only one instance ever executes it - regardless of replica count or a rolling update running two pods at once. Fails closed: a worker that cannot prove it holds the lease does not run.",
